<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian 91-day T-bill yield tumbles.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian 91-day T-bill yield tumbles.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on Lithuanian 91-day Treasury bills tumbled at auction on Monday to 9.62 percent from 11.31 percent amid high demand, the central bank said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of litas.</p>
<p> MATURITY   AV YIELD   LAST WEEK   MIN/MAX    ISSUE  BID    SOLD</p>
<p>  91-day     9.62	 11.31	8.15/10.47  50   108.514  50</p>
<p>Settlement date for today's auction is January 16, and the bills mature on April 17.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
